{"title":"2006 iTest Problems/Problem 25","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iTest_Problems/Problem_25&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The expression <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/3/6/b360106ff0f8813bd7b0ee46348758794d1913d6.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\dfrac{(1+2+\\cdots + 10)(1^3+2^3+\\cdots + 10^3)}{(1^2+2^2+\\cdots + 10^2)^2}\\]\" width=\"299\" height=\"43\" /> reduces to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/c/3/cc39f6ba583f6159aadcb898b5f7677688db8f89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\tfrac mn$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"14\" height=\"18\" />, where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/0/f5047d1e0cbb50ec208923a22cd517c55100fa7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> are relatively prime positive integers. Find <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/2/d/02dbab3601fa6cce490d54263017048f69e1a35d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m+n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"51\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iTest_Problems/Problem_25&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The sum of integers from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/c/65c448713d12675007d0a39c52cdf4ea1d88f917.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\tfrac{n(n+1)}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"46\" height=\"23\" />, the sum of squares of integers from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/b/e/9be2477a10e5f0c9f26886c4ea737c3535502df4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\tfrac{n(n+1)(2n+1)}{6}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"88\" height=\"23\" />, and the sum of cubes of integers from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/3/9/939552338418a40ab5d8abe5457b29b14e61db14.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(\\tfrac{n(n+1)}{2})^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"67\" height=\"23\" />. By applying the formulas, we can simplify the expression and reduce common factors.\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/3/ed3c82c833af7a8df70fc11288d797106b19a3db.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{\\frac{10 \\cdot 11}{2} \\cdot (\\frac{10 \\cdot 11}{2})^2}{(\\frac{10 \\cdot 11 \\cdot 21}{6})^2}\\]\" width=\"104\" height=\"47\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/c/0/1c0bf00cb0b0db843b4f40f15c28ee6385ca1cc5.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{(\\frac{10 \\cdot 11}{2})^3}{(\\frac{10 \\cdot 11 \\cdot 21}{6})^2}\\]\" width=\"73\" height=\"47\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/6/7/f6766347283c00034e6c09dbad1504537c697221.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{10^3 \\cdot 11^3}{8} \\cdot \\frac{36}{10^2 \\cdot 11^2 \\cdot 21^2}\\]\" width=\"185\" height=\"39\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/b/b/3bb7b19fa1e2964022c7e11ed871523cbcc58880.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{10 \\cdot 11 \\cdot 9}{2 \\cdot 21^2}\\]\" width=\"72\" height=\"38\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/8/8/888f494cb2864a3c0d7463c6935762b93e337516.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{5 \\cdot 11}{49}\\]\" width=\"40\" height=\"38\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/5/2/052bd2bbabbbda47421ee6230bf337791a1676f6.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{55}{49}\\]\" width=\"18\" height=\"38\" />\nThus, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/d/ffd2830b1139f797ce7ef396d417111743c9d331.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m+n = \\boxed{104}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"112\" height=\"23\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iTest_Problems/Problem_25&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iTest\" title=\"2006 iTest\">2006 iTest</a> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iTe